NOTE ON THE CORPUS

`data/corpus/` contains publicly published regulations and directives of
Boğaziçi University (bogazici.edu.tr), included here as evaluation material.
Those documents are the property of their publisher and are not covered by the
MIT license above. They are redistributed on the understanding that they are
public documents; if you reuse this repository, review that assumption for your
jurisdiction and consider swapping in your own corpus - `scripts/build_index.py`
rebuilds the index from whatever is in that directory.
